have opposite signs, which == of MPFR parts, an absolute epsilon, took for one) (Giac's path for a polynomial with no closed form takes proot of the coefficients' evalf, which drops the 10^-30 term at Digits 12, and realroot to epsilon, wrong past the 12th digit at Digits 40).
